{"2482200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Emergency Call 112 - The Attack Squad", "steam_appid": 2482200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482200/extras/4d4b318a34df519a14be4f5ffc5c4c96.avif?t=1759394547\" width=600 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a member of the attack squad, you carry out a variety of exciting missions ranging from apartment and car fires to rescuing people as well as many others. Do you have what it takes to complete the challenges ahead? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you arrive on the scene, you start where the attack squad begins to operate. The extinguishing water connection is already in place, the turntable ladder is ready for use and all the materials you need for an indoor or outdoor attack are at your disposal right from the start. You are therefore well equipped to successfully complete any operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After you arrive you first have to survey the scene to get an overview of the situation. Then you can start to work on the primary and secondary objec­tives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the situation, you will have to decide for yourself in which order you want to complete the tasks. However, be prepared for incidents that may occur during the operation, such as explo­sions of gas cylinders, if they are not found and extinguished in time. During the missions, remember that your own safety and that of the people involved is always paramount!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Do you have what it takes to master the exciting everyday work of the attack squad?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482200/extras/495fccd6eacb5723aec21757e832f55d.avif?t=1759394547\" width=600 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of the attack squad and complete a variety of different missions</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the operation site, decide on the tactical approach and work through the mission</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tactical decisions influence the further course of the mission</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission is evaluated so that you can constantly improve yourself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use equipment such as a smoke screen, Halli­gan bar, turntable ladder or various extinguishing agents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in first-person perspective, manage your inventory, and interact with the characters in the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482200/extras/bfb32d995247eaf6141b12ab4b5bc055.avif?t=1759394547\" width=600 height=237 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482200/extras/4d4b318a34df519a14be4f5ffc5c4c96.avif?t=1759394547\" width=600 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a member of the attack squad, you carry out a variety of exciting missions ranging from apartment and car fires to rescuing people as well as many others. Do you have what it takes to complete the challenges ahead? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you arrive on the scene, you start where the attack squad begins to operate. The extinguishing water connection is already in place, the turntable ladder is ready for use and all the materials you need for an indoor or outdoor attack are at your disposal right from the start. You are therefore well equipped to successfully complete any operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After you arrive you first have to survey the scene to get an overview of the situation. Then you can start to work on the primary and secondary objec­tives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the situation, you will have to decide for yourself in which order you want to complete the tasks. However, be prepared for incidents that may occur during the operation, such as explo­sions of gas cylinders, if they are not found and extinguished in time. During the missions, remember that your own safety and that of the people involved is always paramount!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Do you have what it takes to master the exciting everyday work of the attack squad?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482200/extras/495fccd6eacb5723aec21757e832f55d.avif?t=1759394547\" width=600 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of the attack squad and complete a variety of different missions</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the operation site, decide on the tactical approach and work through the mission</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tactical decisions influence the further course of the mission</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission is evaluated so that you can constantly improve yourself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use equipment such as a smoke screen, Halli­gan bar, turntable ladder or various extinguishing agents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in first-person perspective, manage your inventory, and interact with the characters in the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482200/extras/bfb32d995247eaf6141b12ab4b5bc055.avif?t=1759394547\" width=600 height=237 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Take on the role of the attack squad and complete a variety of diverse missions ranging from apartment fires to rescuing people and many more. Get an overview of the situation at the scene and decide strategically how to tackle the upcoming tasks depending on the situation!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482200/cace69b7aa2a7a5b8ceba0eb81e9b4693056ac62/header.jpg?t=1759394547", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482200/40724a21a6b51331138dc7bcaf15e50ca80a2e40/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759394547", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482200/40724a21a6b51331138dc7bcaf15e50ca80a2e40/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759394547", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 1500X / Intel i5-6600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GPU mit 4 GB VRAM, Nvidia GeForce GTX 1060 (4 GB) oder AMD Radeon RX 560 (6GB) (keine Unterstützung von OnBoard Grafikkarten)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> onboard</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 1500X / Intel i5-6600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GPU mit 4 GB VRAM, Nvidia GeF